{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784008966551,"sessionID":"ses_0a0d4fc39ffewTDvsAh9z2s7sZ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_uHiuUwaJyuuugNY4UGjwwAQY","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{
  "summary": "napi-macros 是一组用于简化 Node.js N-API 原生扩展编写的 C 预处理宏集合，以单个头文件 napi-macros.h 形式经 npm 分发。它把模块初始化、方法声明、参数解析、返回值构造、错误抛出，以及 C 结构体布局（sizeof/offsetof/对齐）导出等样板代码封装为 NAPI_* 宏，让开发者用极少代码写出符合 N-API 规范的 .node 扩展。库本体没有运行时、没有第三方依赖，仅在使用方编译扩展时被 #include 展开。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "模块与函数样板宏",
      "description": "NAPI_INIT/NAPI_METHOD/NAPI_EXPORT_FUNCTION 等，封装 N-API 模块注册与 JS 方法声明的样板流程，一行宏替代手写 napi_module 注册与 napi_create_function 调用。",
      "evidence": ["napi-macros.h:4", "napi-macros.h:58", "napi-macros.h:153"]
    },
    {
      "name": "参数解析与类型转换",
      "description": "NAPI_ARGV/NAPI_ARGV_INT32/NAPI_ARGV_UINT32/NAPI_ARGV_UTF8/NAPI_ARGV_BUFFER 等，从 napi_callback_info 取出 JS 参数并校验类型，类型不匹配时抛出 JS 异常。",
      "evidence": ["napi-macros.h:232", "napi-macros.h:204", "napi-macros.h:188", "napi-macros.h:218"]
    },
    {
      "name": "返回值构造",
      "description": "NAPI_RETURN_INT32/NAPI_RETURN_UINT32/NAPI_RETURN_UTF8/NAPI_RETURN_STRING，把 C 值包装为 napi_value 返回给 JS 调用方。",
      "evidence": ["napi-macros.h:170", "napi-macros.h:175", "napi-macros.h:180"]
    },
    {
      "name": "错误处理与回调封装",
      "description": "NAPI_STATUS_THROWS/NAPI_STATUS_THROWS_VOID/NAPI_UV_THROWS/NAPI_MAKE_CALLBACK，检查 napi_status 与 libuv 错误码并抛出 JS 异常，封装带异常捕获的 napi_make_callback。",
